    "insert": "\t\t\tThe proposal mentions the general limitations of current AI assistants and their current features to underline the importance of visualizations. However, it lacks of specific examples of SOTA AI assistants. Provide examples of current AI assistants and how their limitations in visual input or 3D visualisation impact user interaction. \n(Language)"
