  },
  {
    "insert": "\t\t\tThe introduction and teaser sections could benefit from a stronger, more engaging hook to immediately capture the reader’s attention and clearly highlight the significance of the proposed work.\nThe introduction jumps into facts about AI assistant usage and limitations without offering a compelling, attention-grabbing statement or scenario that immediately makes the reader excited about the potential of this research.\nStart with a hook that immediately presents the significance of the research in a relatable way.\n\n"
